#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_none.rst:5
msgid "Select none"
msgstr "取消选择"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_none.rst:7
msgid ""
"To be sure that any `part`_ is selected before any action, QElectroTech "
"provides the option to unselect all `parts`_ from the `workspace`_. This "
"option is useful for avoiding undesired changes."
msgstr ""
"为了确定任何 `部件 <part_>`_ 在任何动作之前被选中，QElectroTech 提供了从 `部件 <parts_>`_ 中解选所有 `工作区 "
"<workspace_>`_ 的选项。 此选项对避免不想要的更改很有用 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_none.rst:10
msgid ""
"Unselecting all `parts`_ can be done from `menu bar`_ or using the "
"corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "取消选择所有 `部件 <parts_>`_ 可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 完成，也可以使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_none.rst:13
msgid "Select none from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏中选择无"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_none.rst:15
msgid "Select **Edit > Select none** to unselect all selected `parts`_."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 选择无** 取消所有选中的 `部件 <parts_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_none.rst:20
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素编辑器编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_none.rst:23
msgid "Select none using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "没有使用键盘快捷键选择"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_none.rst:25
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_none.rst:27
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + Shift + a`` to unselect all selected `parts`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + Shift + a`` 取消所有选中 `部件 <parts_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_none.rst:31
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
